flowchart TD
  HOST[Host StreamRequest] --> REPLAY[Serialize conversation and tool specs]
  REPLAY --> GUARD[Load local native-execution guard]
  GUARD --> READY{Fresh guarded agent registered?}
  READY -->|No| FAIL[Stop with CLI configuration error]
  READY -->|Yes| CHILD[Local OpenCode CLI with built-in profile]
  CHILD --> MODEL[Connected model provider]
  MODEL --> JSONL[OpenCode JSONL events]
  JSONL --> FRAME[Assemble lines and normalize snapshots]
  FRAME --> ERR{Provider error?}
  ERR -->|Yes| VISIBLE[Report actionable failure]
  ERR -->|No| PROTOCOL[Parse text, thinking, or host tool request]
  PROTOCOL --> LOOP[Host agent loop]
  LOOP --> PERMISSION[Validate and check permissions]
  PERMISSION --> TOOL[Execute host tool]
  TOOL --> HOST
